OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be cloudy with outbreaks of rain.
OL,7,FThen the rest of the night will be
OL,8,Fcloudy with further outbreaks of rain,
OL,9,Fturning heavy in the west later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FCloudy with occasionally
OL,12,Fheavy rain spreading north in the
OL,13,Fmorning. Staying cloudy in the
OL,14,Fafternoon with further showery rain,
OL,15,Foccasionally heavy with a chance of
OL,16,Fthunder.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
